ars of his life two years ago all of a  sudden he's pro-life right before he  runs for president even if we don't  believe it if Trump will kowtow to the  March for life as he did if he's going  to talk about and try to restrict  abortion that's what matters and it's  the exact same thing with guns whatever  it is that Trump has said in the past  including being critical of the NRA it  doesn't matter because what Trump is  saying now as president Trump is what's  actually going to impact policy and it  just so happens that  is also doing the opposite of what he  claims to want saying that mental  illness is the problem and not the guns  but he also made it easier in February  of 2017 for people with mental illness  to get those guns very very dangerous  stuff and listen I just want the  hypocrisy to end that's really what I  want here send me your thoughts I'm on  Twitter at D Pakman the show is on  Twitter at David Pakman show
 

